{"ref":"BDB, עָוָה²","hw":"עָוָה²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עָוָה</span>]</big>  <strong>vb. denom.</strong> (Gerber<sup>90</sup>) <strong>commit iniquity, do wrong (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">עוי</span> <em>commit sin</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲוָיָא</span> <em>sin</em>, cf. Levy<sup>NHWB iii. 626</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  (late) Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָֽוְתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:16\" href=\"/Esther.1.16\">Est 1:16</a> <em>she hath done wrong</em> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>); 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָוִינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:5\" href=\"/Daniel.9.5\">Dn 9:5</a> <em>we have committed iniquity</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָטָא</span>).<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  <em>commit iniquity;</em>—Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶעֱוָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.20\">2 S 19:20</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶעֱוֵיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.17\">24:17</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָטָא</span>); 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶעֱוִינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:47\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.47\">1 K 8:47</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:37\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.37\">2 Ch 6:37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:6\" href=\"/Psalms.106.6\">ψ 106:6</a> (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָטָא</span>); Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַעֲוֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.4\">Je 9:4</a>, cstr. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַעֲוֹתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.14\">2 S 7:14</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Job 33:27\" href=\"/Job.33.27\">Jb 33:27</a> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עָוָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עָוָה\">I. עָוָה</a>.","next":"BDB, עַוָּה²","prev":"BDB, עָוֹן"}